 "body": "These changes add Touch Bar support to the IDE using the [JTouchBar](https://github.com/Thizzer/JTouchBar) library. Version 0.2.0 snapshot was used because of https://github.com/Thizzer/JTouchBar/issues/10.\r\n\r\nThe current behaviour is to map the Editor toolbar items to the Touch Bar. The rollover state icon is used by default. When a button is pressed it goes to the active state and uses the yellow icons, the state is also synced with the toolbar state in the UI.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"501\" alt=\"screen shot 2018-10-31 at 9 52 31 am\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1163840/47807570-d2c3d780-dd12-11e8-834d-99c497e6124d.png\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1085\" alt=\"touch bar shot 2018-10-31 at 12 46 27 pm\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1163840/47807586-db1c1280-dd12-11e8-9a35-7420d080db17.png\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1085\" alt=\"touch bar shot 2018-10-31 at 1 44 38 pm\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1163840/47807704-26362580-dd13-11e8-94fe-b323678c4d6c.png\">\r\n",
